    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go back to the hospital if i can help it. the drive is like an hour and it's so expensive. it's probably just inflammation from the surgery right? my doc said some swelling was normal. can i just take some extra ibuprofen or maybe some aspirin to help with the swelling and see if it goes down by tomorrow?",
