      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not rely on the idea that this is just normal inflammation; the symptoms you describe are a major warning sign. Since you are concerned about the drive, you can try to call your surgeon's office right now and explain the symptoms to them, as they can advise on the next steps. However, taking extra ibuprofen or aspirin without professional guidance is risky, especially if a clot is present. You need a proper medical assessment to rule out a deep vein thrombosis.",
