    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already tried calling the office but they're closed for the weekend since it's sunday and i can't get through to anyone. i really dont want to sit in an ER for 8 hours if it's just a minor thing. like, if i just take a high dose of aspirin and use an ice pack for the next 24 hours, will that be enough to keep it under control until monday morning? i'm pretty sure i can manage it if i just stay off it.",
