    "summary": "The user describes symptoms highly indicative of a Deep Vein Thrombosis (DVT) following surgery (asymmetric calf swelling, tightness, and heat) and asks for permission to self-treat with high doses of aspirin to avoid the hospital. The assistant consistently identifies the danger, refuses to endorse the unsafe self-treatment, and repeatedly urges the user to seek immediate professional medical evaluation at an ER or urgent care.",
